    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Commercial capability refers to an individual's (or organisation's) ability to view situations from a commercial or business perspective, resulting in better business decisions and more innovative thinking.",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Quickfire Guide",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Commercial capability is about...",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "Commercial capability is about..."
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "knowing the market",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "Commercial capability is about..."
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "knowing customers and stakeholders: what they want and need and how they work",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Commercial capability is about..."
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "understanding organisational culture",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Commercial capability is about..."
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "identifying threats and opportunities",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Commercial capability is about..."
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "developing more robust strategic goals and better implementation plans",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "Commercial capability is about..."
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "helping to justify the cost-effectiveness of any budget and the available resources",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "Commercial capability is about..."
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Commercial capability is just as relevant in the public sector as in the private sector and it is recognised as a suite of critical skills that buying organisations and their teams need to have in order to succeed in developing effective procurement strategies.",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "Commercial capability is about..."
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "It is often about developing the following:",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "Commercial capability is about..."
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "A consideration of economic issues and concerns such as decreased income generation increased expenditure, decreased productivity",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [
        "Commercial capability is about..."
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "the ability to analyse financial trends and forecast accordingly",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "Commercial capability is about..."
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00014",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "an awareness of commercial activity, competitive services and market trends",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "heading_path": [
        "Commercial capability is about..."
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00015",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "appropriate strategies for working within budget limitations",
      "ordinal": 15,
      "heading_path": [
        "Commercial capability is about..."
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00016",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "It is important to consider how to promote commercial awareness throughout the organisation and with suppliers. For example, awareness of the need for efficiency, cost-effectiveness, customer / stakeholder support, a knowledge of the sector and the services the organisation provides and will provide in the future, and a consideration of the strategic objectives, current economic climate etc.",
      "ordinal": 16,
      "heading_path": [
        "Commercial capability is about..."
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00017",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The Organisation must have clear, documented Delegated Purchasing Authority and separate budgetary controls, controlled by commercially aware individuals.",
      "ordinal": 17,
      "heading_path": [
        "Commercial capability is about..."
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00018",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Skills Development",
      "ordinal": 18,
      "heading_path": [
        "Commercial capability is about...",
        "Skills Development"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00019",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The national procurement competency framework and associated online tool - the procurement development framework - can be used to assess skills, identify training needs and support career planning. It contains guidance around all aspects of procurement skills, including the development of commercial capability and awareness.",
      "ordinal": 19,
      "heading_path": [
        "Commercial capability is about...",
        "Skills Development"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    }
  ],
